<h2>The statutory map: who may claim what</h2>
<table class="law">
  <tr><th>Provision</th><th>Who can claim</th><th>What is available</th></tr>
  <tr><td>Section 24, HMA</td><td>Either spouse</td><td>Litigation expenses and monthly maintenance pendente lite, where the claimant has no independent income sufficient for support.</td></tr>
  <tr><td>Section 25, HMA</td><td>Either spouse</td><td>Permanent alimony and maintenance, at the time of any decree or subsequently, variable on change of circumstances.</td></tr>
